    "title": "Elkins sweeps Big 10 XC championships | Bridgeport Sports | wvnews.com",
    "text": "KINGWOOD, W.Va. — The boys and girls Big 10 team championships were both won by Elkins at the Big 10 Conference Cross Country Championships on Thursday at Preston High School.\nElkins’ Trevor George (16:09.9) was the conference champ and Grafton’s Chase Maier was the runner-up individually with a time of 17:00.6.",
